    {
      "id": "s8",
      "title": "The whole picture",
      "text": "A junk drawer makes Claude open everything; a labelled cabinet lets one search find the right file. Raw data stays raw, scripts make the rest, names start with the date, and a short CLAUDE.md explains the layout.",
      "show": [
        "messy",
        "tidy",
        "rule",
        "term",
        "map",
        "try"
